### Login admin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### Login user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jamie_lynn",
  "password": "password"
}

### Logout user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/logout


### Register/add user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jamie_lynn@yahoo.com",
  "password": "password",
  "firstName": "Jamie",
  "lastName": "Lynn",
  "phone": "0157595248586"
}



### Test get me: only with admin role possible
GET http://localhost:4000/admin/auth/me

### Update user role
POST http://localhost:4000/admin/auth/23b0610a-3359-4837-88ff-42ffc5423fce/role/SHOP

### Delete specific user
DELETE http://localhost:4000/admin/auth/delete-user/23b0610a-3359-4837-88ff-42ffc5423fce



### Data agent
GET http://localhost:4000/admin/auth/generate-data?shop=5&cost=10

### Delete users
DELETE http://localhost:4000/admin/auth/reset-all
